        // and the returned shares must be consistent with convertToShares preview: convertToShares(assets) should equal what investment manager would convert.
        // We cannot read events in-contract, so instead assert a relation between totalAssets and totalSupply via investmentManager view functions:
        // After a successful deposit, totalAssets should be >= totalAssets_before (non-decreasing) and totalSupply should be >= totalSupply_before.
        // If the call reverted, neither totalAssets nor totalSupply should have changed.

        if (reverted) {
            assert(totalAssets_after == totalAssets_before && totalSupply_after == totalSupply_before);
